  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "A body is moving unidirectionally under the influence of a source&nbsp;of constant power. The square of its displacement in time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math> is proportional to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "h5bDP",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sr9mo",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3tKv3",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hsT3A",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>t</mi></msqrt></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>By work-energy theorem,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>P</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>s</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8733;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p>",
